<title>TURKEY: TURK TOFAS OTOMOBIL H1 NET PROFITS FALL.</title>
<headline>TURK TOFAS OTOMOBIL H1 NET PROFITS FALL.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan-June 1997 final</p>
<p>(billion lira unless stated)</p>
<p>				    H1 1997	   H1 1996</p>
<p>				    -------	   -------</p>
<p>    Per share profit (lira)   208.09  vs     364.90</p>
<p>    Net profit		  2,621.98  vs   3,065.13</p>
<p>    Net sales		  43,909.00  vs  30,971.91</p>
<p>    Operating loss	    1,195.65  vs   3,290.92 profit</p>
<p>    Exceptional income	6,357.65  vs   1,703.79</p>
<p>    Interest paid	     1,268.46  vs   1,375.75</p>
<p>    Total debts		29,391.71  vs  14,048.08</p>
<p>    Equity		     28,605.25  vs  20,875.83</p>
<p>    Capital		    12,600.00  vs   8 400.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Turkey's leading car maker Tofas Turk Otomobil Fabrikasi AS is equally owned by Koc Holding and Italy's Fiat Auto, with each holding a 37.86 percent stake.</p>
<p>The figures above do not take into account Turkey's 78 percent year-on-year consumer price inflation in June.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul Newsroom +90-212 275 08 75</p>
</text>
